Modifications made for Bliss:
  - src/window_renderer.rs: SceneOverlay/set_scene_effects hooks, used by
    Bliss's mustang GPU post-processor (blur/transform CSS effects). This
    is the majority of the divergence from upstream.
  - src/scene.rs, src/lib.rs, src/image_renderer.rs, src/custom_paint_source.rs:
    smaller supporting changes for the above.

